Homepage: https://github.com/SnakeU2/bash-it-dpkg/

Package: bash-it-dpkg
Architecture: all
Depends: bash
Description: System-wide bash-it with CLI enable/disable
 Bash-it is a customizable framework for managing bash configurations.
 This package installs it once in /opt/bash-it and provides the command
 'bash-it enable' to activate it per-user with personal plugins, themes,
 and aliases. No code duplication.
 .
